s2-2-p11 = prose (cons "The relation over fixed carriers is the dependent family \(R:A\times B\to\mathcal U\), equivalently its total space equipped with both projections to \(A\) and \(B\). An equivalence of presentations must commute with those projections. A bare equivalence of total spaces forgets which inputs and outputs the witnesses relate." nil)
